Extension: KenyaAmbulanceCaseStatus
Id: ke-emmergency-ambulance-case-status
Title: "Ambulance Case Status"
Description: "The detailed lifecycle status of a Kenya ambulance case, using the Kenya-specific status codes that do not map one-to-one onto the base FHIR Encounter.status ValueSet."
* value[x] only code
* valueCode from AmbulanceCaseStatusVS (required)
